            "uco-core:description": "AG investigators and Virden Police searched a residence in the 300 block of East Holden Street, Virden. The defendant was arrested after evidence was found. The source does not state a warrant, a CyberTip assigned to this matter, resistance, or weapons. CAC SHACL allows one performer.",
